definition in jbovlaste, aren't clear: "p, x1 = katna1 (cutter), x2 = kerfa2 
(hairy) = katna2 (be cut)". Is this supposed to be x1=p1, x2=ka1, x3=ke2=ka2, 
or x1=p1=ka1, x2=ke2=ka2? The latter doesn't make sense (barbers aren't 
scissors), but the former doesn't match the x1 and x2 in NORALUJV.

